            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Leave to Attend Professional Meetings—Upon written application in advance, and with the recommendation of the appropriate official, the superintendent may grant a unit member leave to attend professional meetings (e.g., conventions, conferences, or committees) as participant or observer without loss of salary.",
